ota/lawrence-county"],["ARC or PLC in Lawrence County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/lawrence-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 43 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 170% of normal in July to August and 73% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 48% in February to March and 66% in June to July of 2026. Grids 28907 and 29207 hit their driest year in 2012 at 57%.</p>"}
